%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'useMaxWidth': false, 'sequence': {'wrap': true, 'wrapPadding': 10, 'width': 200}, 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '18px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Auto as Automation
    participant U as Operator (UI)
    participant API as Control Plane
    participant queue as Task Queue
    participant SCH as Scheduler
    participant EX as Executor
    participant AG as Agent Container
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    Note over Auto,U: Automation submits. Operator observes and can intervene. Executor and Control Plane communicate only through the queue.

    Auto->>API: POST /tasks (prompt, tools, secret_ids)
    API->>API: Build scope (HMAC: project, task, secret_ids, TTL)
    API->>API: Persist task
    API->>queue: enqueue task
    API-->>Auto: 202 task_id

    U->>API: WS connect (subscribe to task events)
    SCH->>queue: pick task
    SCH->>EX: Submit(task_spec + scope_token) (one-shot handoff)
    EX->>EX: Pull image
    EX->>AG: Start container, inject secrets as env / tmpfs
    Note over AG,EX: Agent is a black box. Runs initial instructions. No platform API.

    AG->>LLM: Prompt + history
    LLM-->>AG: Completion or tool_use

    loop agent loop
        AG-->>EX: stdout (event stream)
        EX->>queue: publish events (task_id, kind, payload)
        queue->>API: fan-out events
        API-->>U: WS push (live)
        opt Operator intervenes
            U->>API: inject message / cancel / rerun
            API->>queue: publish control event (cancel / intervene)
            queue->>EX: control event
            EX-->>AG: forward (or stop)
        end
        AG->>LLM: Next prompt
        LLM-->>AG: Next completion
    end

    AG-->>EX: final result (stdout / exit code)
    EX->>queue: publish final event (status)
    queue->>API: fan-out final
    API->>API: UPDATE state to terminal
    API-->>Auto: webhook / status (if configured)
    API-->>U: WS final
    Note over AG,EX: Container terminated. Scope token expires.
